    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ we lærað þæt, þeah hwa agylte ⁊ hine sylfne deope forwyrce, ðonne gefadie man ða steore, swa hit for Gode sy gebeorhlic ⁊ for worulde aberendlic.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we enjoin that, even if anyone sins and commits grievous crime, the punishment shall be ordered as shall be justifiable in the sight of God and acceptable in the eyes of men.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And we lærað, þæt, þeah hwa agylte ⁊ hine sylfne deope forwyrce, þonne gefadige man steore, swa hit for Gode sy gebeorhlic ⁊ for worulde aberendlic.</ab>
      </div>
